.TH "SPGEN" "1" "" "spgen 0.1.0" ""
.SH NAME
spgen \- spgen — the blueprint generators' own tool
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBspgen\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
spgen — the blueprint generators' own tool
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
spgen\-generate(1)
no arguments: the capability list; with them, run a generator or suite
.TP
spgen\-validate(1)
model completeness (the sp.check rules) — writes nothing
.TP
spgen\-man(1)
the manual page of a generator, or the index when no generator is given
.TP
spgen\-arch(1)
where generated code lives (location) or what it is named (name)
.TP
spgen\-capabilities(1)
the capability tree as text
.TP
spgen\-mcp(1)
start the MCP server on stdio (read\-only tools)
.TP
spgen\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
.SH EXTRA
The tiers: blueprints render units; generators run blueprints; suites run generators.
The generators themselves are reached by operators through the bindings: mix sp.gen.* and pnpm spgen.
.SH GENERATORS
.SS elixir
.TP
\fBread_model\fR
Generates the shared read model with its changesets
.br
mix sp.gen.read_model <element> [options]
.TP
\fBtest_support\fR
Generates a read model's test\-support fixtures and factory functions
.br
mix sp.gen.test_support <element> [options]
.TP
\fBevent\fR
Generates an event module and its test describe block
.br
mix sp.gen.event <element> [options]
.TP
\fBaggregate\fR
Generates the aggregate module with apply/2 clauses per event
.br
mix sp.gen.aggregate <element> [options]
.TP
\fBquery\fR
Generates a query module for a query element
.br
mix sp.gen.query <element> [options]
.TP
\fBinternal_api\fR
Generates the internal API accessors for a constituent
.br
mix sp.gen.internal_api <element> [options]
.TP
\fBcommand\fR
Generates a command module, its test and router registration
.br
mix sp.gen.command <element> [options]
.TP
\fBcommand_handler\fR
Generates a command handler module and its test describe block
.br
mix sp.gen.command_handler <element> [options]
.TP
\fBprojector\fR
Generates a projector clause for an event and registers the projector
.br
mix sp.gen.projector <element> [options]
.TP
\fBpolicy\fR
Generates the authorization policy for an operation
.br
mix sp.gen.policy <element> [options]
.TP
\fBpublic_api\fR
Generates the public API function for an operation
.br
mix sp.gen.public_api <element> [options]
.TP
\fBview\fR
Generates the JSON:API view for a read model
.br
mix sp.gen.view <element> [options]
.TP
\fBschema\fR
Generates OpenAPI schemas documenting an endpoint
.br
mix sp.gen.schema <element> [options]
.TP
\fBcontroller\fR
Generates the controller action, endpoint test and route
.br
mix sp.gen.controller <element> [options]
.TP
\fBbruno\fR
Generates the Bruno API\-request documentation for an operation
.br
mix sp.gen.bruno <element> [options]
.SS typescript
.TP
\fBdomain\-object\fR
Generates the domain object interface and its fields type
.br
pnpm spgen domain\-object <read\-model>
.TP
\fBschema\fR
Generates the WarpDrive resource schema and the citizen's registrations
.br
pnpm spgen schema <read\-model>
.TP
\fBactions\fR
Generates one request\-option builder per command
.br
pnpm spgen actions <read\-model>
.TP
\fBqueries\fR
Generates one query function per model query
.br
pnpm spgen queries <read\-model>
.TP
\fBabilities\fR
Generates one ability predicate per command from the model's actors
.br
pnpm spgen abilities <read\-model>
.TP
\fBfixtures\fR
Generates a frozen const and find helpers per model example
.br
pnpm spgen fixtures <read\-model>
.TP
\fBendpoints\fR
Generates the MSW endpoint descriptors and mock handlers
.br
pnpm spgen endpoints <read\-model>
.TP
\fBability\-test\fR
Generates the role truth table test of each ability
.br
pnpm spgen ability\-test <read\-model>
.TP
\fBstorybook\fR
Generates the storybook argTypes, presets and meta factory
.br
pnpm spgen storybook <read\-model>
.SH SUITES
.SS elixir
.TP
\fBmix sp.gen.operation\fR
read_model, event, aggregate, query, command, command_handler, projector, policy, public_api
.TP
\fBmix sp.gen.endpoint\fR
view, schema, controller, bruno
.TP
\fBmix sp.gen.feature\fR
read_model, test_support, event, aggregate, query, command, command_handler, projector, policy, public_api, view, schema, controller, bruno
.SS typescript
.TP
\fBpnpm spgen domain\-objects\fR
domain\-object, schema, actions, queries, abilities
.TP
\fBpnpm spgen test\-support\fR
fixtures, endpoints
.TP
\fBpnpm spgen ability\-tests\fR
ability\-test
.TP
\fBpnpm spgen storybook\fR
storybook
.TP
\fBpnpm spgen feature\fR
domain\-object, schema, actions, queries, abilities, fixtures, endpoints, ability\-test, storybook
